=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Notice:}** Wait one game day and re-zone after completing {q:Fires of Discontent|Fires of Discontent|Fires of Discontent} before starting this quest.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} (H-6) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
** {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} may first remark upon a {k:Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls}, speak with him again to receive the cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Pagdako} at (H-9) for some dialogue.
* Speak to {n:Blatherix} at (F-8). Trade him 30 {i:Gob. Chocolate|Gob. Chocolate|4495} or 5,000 gil to receive a {@k}{k:Mine shaft key}
** {i:Gob. Chocolate|Gob. Chocolate|4495} is sold by {n:Pawkrix} in Lower Jeuno (H-10).
* Zone in to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} from {z:Grauberg (S)} for a brief cutscene.
** {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Grauberg (S)} is quickest way.
** Voidwatch teleport from an {p:Atmacite Refiner} in the past to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} will also put you at the {z:Grauberg (S)} zone line.
* Examine the Corroded Door in {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} (F-5) to enter a battlefield.
* In the battlefield, you will encounter x1 {m:Sapphire Quadav} and x10 {m:Sapphirine Quadav}.
** It is best to defeat six of the {m:Sapphirine Quadavs|Sapphirine Quadav} first, as defeating the {m:Sapphire Quadav} will cause the {m:Sapphirine Quadavs|Sapphirine Quadav} to scatter around the map. Defeating enough Quadav will clear the mission, returning you back to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)}.

\**Notice:** If for any reason your inventory is full before starting this next step below then you will not obtain the reward and you will have to rewatch the entire cutscene, choice selections included.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} for a cutscene. In it, you are given the opportunity to answer questions. You can choose again if you answer incorrectly, but these are the correct answers:
** "...the ventilation shaft."
** "...the senator did not light the lantern."
** "...he was distracted."
* When the cutscene ends you will receive your reward.

